---
title: Dead Letter Queue and Replay Flow
---
flowchart LR
    DLQ[(Dead Letter Queue)] --> Review[Review DLQ entries\nfilter by topic / time / error]

    Review --> Inspect[Inspect full payload\nand error history]
    Inspect --> Decision{Root cause\nresolved?}

    Decision -->|No| Fix[Fix root cause:\nadapter bug / ERP issue / schema mismatch]
    Fix --> Decision

    Decision -->|Yes| SingleReplay[Replay single event\nverify fix works]
    SingleReplay --> Verify{Processing\nsuccessful?}

    Verify -->|No| Fix
    Verify -->|Yes| BatchReplay[Replay affected batch\nby time range or topic]

    BatchReplay --> Queue[(Message Queue)]
    Queue --> Worker[Worker]

    Worker --> Target{Outcome}
    Target -->|Success| Resolved([Mark DLQ entry resolved])
    Target -->|Failure| DLQ

    style DLQ fill:#3d1a1a,stroke:#e05c5c,color:#f0f0f0
    style Resolved fill:#1a3d1a,stroke:#3dba72,color:#f0f0f0
